{"title":"Career Roadmap: Marine Products Export Executive","role":"Marine Products Export Executive","summary":"Career Domain: Agriculture, Food & Life Sciences · Qualification Pathway: B.Sc – Fisheries Science · Target Career: Marine Products Export Executive","facts":{"Current degree":"B.Sc (Hons) Agriculture and Allied","Course":"Fisheries Science"},"about":[{"label":"About this roadmap","text":"This roadmap was drafted with AI assistance from OneGrasp's related roadmaps and is awaiting expert review. Check fees, dates, eligibility and exam patterns on the official websites before you rely on them."}],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Career Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"A Marine Products Export Executive handles the export of fish and seafood - shrimp, fish, squid - from sourcing and processing to quality checks, documents and shipping, meeting the strict rules of buying countries."},{"type":"h","text":"What a Marine Products Export Executive does"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Coordinate sourcing and processing with plants"},{"text":"Ensure quality, HACCP and buyer standards"},{"text":"Prepare export documents and certificates"},{"text":"Talk to buyers and track shipments"}]},{"type":"p","text":"Where they work:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Seafood processing and export companies"},{"text":"Exporters' trading offices"},{"text":"Cold-chain and logistics firms"},{"text":"MPEDA and export-promotion bodies"}]}]},{"heading":"Career Horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Career stage","Typical role"],"rows":[[{"text":"Entry-level"},{"text":"Export Executive"}],[{"text":"Early career"},{"text":"Senior Executive"}],[{"text":"Mid-level"},{"text":"Export Manager"}],[{"text":"Senior"},{"text":"Head of Exports"}],[{"text":"Leadership"},{"text":"Own export business"}]]}]},{"heading":"Year-by-Year Learning Roadmap","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Year 1: Fisheries foundations"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Fish biology, aquaculture and fishing technology"},{"text":"Visit a fish landing centre"},{"text":"Improve English and business writing"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 2: Processing and quality"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Fish processing technology and microbiology"},{"text":"Learn HACCP and seafood quality standards"},{"text":"Visit a processing plant"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 3: Trade"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Learn export procedures, documentation and MPEDA registration"},{"text":"Study EU, US and Japan import rules"},{"text":"Intern with a seafood exporter"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Year 4: Get hired"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Project on an export product's value chain"},{"text":"Learn Incoterms and letters of credit"},{"text":"Apply to exporters and processors"}]}]},{"heading":"Essential Skills","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Skill","Type"],"rows":[[{"text":"Seafood processing and quality"},{"text":"Technical"}],[{"text":"HACCP"},{"text":"Technical"}],[{"text":"Export documentation"},{"text":"Technical"}],[{"text":"International trade rules"},{"text":"Technical"}],[{"text":"Buyer communication"},{"text":"Professional"}],[{"text":"Attention to detail"},{"text":"Professional"}],[{"text":"Negotiation"},{"text":"Professional"}]]}]},{"heading":"Tools and Technologies to Learn","kind":"build","blocks":[{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Excel"},{"text":"ERP / export software"},{"text":"DGFT and customs portals"}]}]},{"heading":"Internships and Practical Experience","kind":"internships","blocks":[{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Seafood exporters"},{"text":"Processing plants"},{"text":"MPEDA offices"}]}]},{"heading":"Certifications and Additional Training","kind":"certifications","blocks":[{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"HACCP"},{"text":"ISO 22000 awareness"},{"text":"Export-import management course"}]},{"type":"note","label":"Before you enrol","text":"Check the current syllabus, fees and eligibility on